      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4071,
      "text": "Say, “I truly fear, if I were to disobey my Lord, the punishment of a momentous Day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4072,
      "text": "Say, “It is Allah alone Whom I worship, with sincere devotion to Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4073,
      "text": "So worship whatever you wish besides Him.” Say, “Indeed, the losers are those who will lose themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. That is indeed the clear loss.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4074,
      "text": "They will have layers of fire above them and below them. That is how Allah threatens His slaves. Then fear Me, O My slaves!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4075,
      "text": "But those who shun the worship of false gods[8] and penitently turn to Allah, there are glad tidings for them. So give glad tidings to My slaves,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4076,
      "text": "those who listen to speech[9] and follow the best of it. They are the ones whom Allah has guided, and they are the people of understanding.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4077,
      "text": "Can you save those against whom the decree of punishment has been passed to be in the Fire?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4078,
      "text": "But those who fear their Lord will have lofty mansions[10], built one above another, under which rivers flow. This is the promise of Allah; Allah never breaks His promise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 460,
      "ruku": 397,
      "hizbQuarter": 184,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4079,
      "text": "Do you not see that Allah sends down rain from the sky and makes it flow as springs in the earth, then He brings forth thereby crops of various colors; then they whither and you see them turn yellow; then He causes them to crumble? Indeed, there is a reminder in this for people of understanding.",
      "surah": {
